---
import StanBannerDoodle from '../../assets/stan-banner-doodle.svg';
import StanBanner from '../../assets/stan-banner.svg';
import CenterContainer from '../../components/CenterContainer.astro';
import ContentCard from '../../components/ContentCard.astro';
import DemoVideo from '../../components/DemoVideo.astro';
import Paragraph from '../../components/Paragraph.astro';
import ProjectBanner from '../../components/ProjectBanner.astro';
import Spacer from '../../components/Spacer.astro';
import Layout from '../../layout/Layout.astro';
import { asset } from '../../utils/base-url';
---

<Layout>
	<CenterContainer>
		<ProjectBanner doodleId="stanDoodle">
			<StanBanner slot="logo" />
			<StanBannerDoodle slot="doodle" />
		</ProjectBanner>
		<ContentCard title="My Work At Stan">
			<div class="pad">
				<Paragraph heading="Over four Years,Building Australia's Streaming Platform">
					For the past 4 years, I've been part of the six person team powering <b>Stan</b>,
					Australia's largest homegrown streaming service.
					<br />
					I maintain the core TV app running on 175+ platforms serving 1.6M+ users across smart TVs, game
					consoles, and set top boxes.
					<br />
					From the 2024 Olympics to daily binge watching, every stream on TV runs through code I've written.
				</Paragraph>
				<Spacer />
				<DemoVideo
					src={asset('stan.mp4')}
					poster={asset('stan-poster.jpg')}
					width={1280}
					height={720}
				/>
			</div>
			<div class="pad">
				<Paragraph heading="Open Source,Awards, and Big Wins">
					I contributed a <a
						href="https://github.com/shaka-project/shaka-player/pull/9066"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener"
						class="inline-link"
						>4x performance improvement to Google's open source Shaka Player HLS parser</a
					>, work that earned the Nine Digital Annual Award for "No Stone Left Unturned" (one of
					only four awards given annually).
					<br />
					I led a device performance initiative that brought 2015+ legacy devices onto the latest app
					version, increasing platform coverage by 30%.
					<br />
					As a key contributor to the 2024 Olympics project, I rebuilt core navigation, improved app stability,
					and enhanced analytics and reporting under one of the highest traffic events of the year.
					<br />
					My work spans video playback engineering, performance optimisation, internal tooling, systems
					design and architecture. The focus: making Stan work flawlessly on extremely constrained hardware
					running ancient browser webviews.
				</Paragraph>
			</div>
			<div class="pad">
				<Paragraph heading="The Tech Stack">
					Built with React, TypeScript, and Redux running across Tizen, WebOS, WebMAF and dozens of
					other platforms.
					<br />
					Webpack handles the heavy lifting for 175+ device configurations each with unique quirks and
					limitations. Targeting devices all the way down to Chrome 38 and Safari 7.
					<br />
					I've built custom internal tooling around native tooling gaps, creating a unified dev experience
					across every platform.
					<br />
					It's the kind of infrastructure work that doesn't ship features but makes shipping features
					possible.
				</Paragraph>
			</div>
			<div class="pad">
				<Paragraph heading="Systems, Tools, and Architecture">
					<b>I build the infrastructure and foundational libraries that the platform relies on.</b>
					<br />
					I refactored our monolithic codebase into a highly modular, testable monorepo and designed robust
					cross device testing pipelines to unblock QA.
					<br />
					From remote logging, debugging and testing to modernising platform code to custom runtimes.
					I build the core tooling that keeps our multi platform app stable and devs happy.
				</Paragraph>
			</div>
			<div class="pad">
				<Paragraph heading="Optimisations at Scale">
					<b
						>My performance work goes deep into ancient browsers and hardware limitations. I
						consistently diagnose and fix real performance issues backed by real data.</b
					>
					<br />
					Some of my work includes diagnosing and eliminating redundant React renders, optimising garbage
					collection (yep), forcing hardware decoding and batching network requests between user interactions
					to name a few.
					<br />
					By engineering custom GPU optimized animation hooks that devs adhere to, I stopped layout thrashing
					animations getting into production and ensured smooth UI across even the oldest of platforms.
				</Paragraph>
			</div>
			<div class="pad">
				<Paragraph heading="Team Culture">
					<b>I believe in lifting engineering standards and driving collaboration.</b>
					<br />
					I actively mentor junior developers, host organisation wide tech talks and represent our platform's
					hardware constraints in Stan's internal design system teams.
					<br />
					Championing a strong team culture helped us take home the award for Best Teamwork at Nine Digital's
					annual hackathon.
				</Paragraph>
			</div>
			<Spacer />
		</ContentCard>
		<Spacer triple />
	</CenterContainer>

	<style>
		.inline-link {
			color: var(--text);
			text-decoration: underline;
			text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
			text-underline-offset: 3px;
			transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
		}

		.pad {
			padding: 20px;
		}

		.inline-link:hover {
			opacity: 0.7;
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
